    "provenance": "original",
    "keepEnglishTerms": [
     "nuclear family",
     "joint family",
     "community"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "A family is a group of people related by blood, marriage or adoption. Families can be nuclear (parents and children) or joint (several generations together).\nFamily members share work and care for each other. Elders guide and children help.\nA community is a group of families living together, and it works together for common needs."
    }
